# IdentityVault – App Store Listing

## Title
IdentityVault – Biometric Identity Recovery

## Short Description
Recover your online accounts using your identity, not just passwords.

## Long Description
IdentityVault lets you prove who you are using biometrics and your legal name, then helps you recover access to accounts across multiple platforms. Even if your usernames, emails, or phone numbers have changed, IdentityVault uses your verified identity as the anchor.

Features:
- Biometric identity verification
- Multi‑platform account recovery
- Device account linking
- Secure, encrypted storage (no raw biometrics)

Ideal for:
- People locked out of important accounts
- Users with multiple handles and emails
- Anyone who wants a safer way to recover access.

## Keywords
identity, recovery, biometrics, fingerprint, account access, security, password reset
